       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SECONDLARGEST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ARR.
           05 ARR-ITEM PIC 9(2) OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 FIRST-VAL PIC S9(3) VALUE -1.
       01 SECOND-VAL PIC S9(3) VALUE -1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 5 TO ARR-ITEM(1)
           MOVE 3 TO ARR-ITEM(2)
           MOVE 8 TO ARR-ITEM(3)
           MOVE 1 TO ARR-ITEM(4)
           MOVE 9 TO ARR-ITEM(5)
           MOVE 2 TO ARR-ITEM(6)
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
               IF ARR-ITEM(I) > FIRST-VAL
                   MOVE FIRST-VAL TO SECOND-VAL
                   MOVE ARR-ITEM(I) TO FIRST-VAL
               ELSE IF ARR-ITEM(I) > SECOND-VAL AND ARR-ITEM(I) NOT = FIRST-VAL
                   MOVE ARR-ITEM(I) TO SECOND-VAL
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "SECOND LARGEST: " SECOND-VAL
           STOP RUN.
